-   entry .bottomDockedAnchoring   `Tui.Block.Anchoring.BottomDocked`: always docked at the bottom, re-docking on every resize
-   entry .topAnchoring   `Tui.Block.Anchoring.TopAnchored`: pinned to the top rows from the first frame
-   entry .topAfterResizeAnchoring   `Tui.Block.Anchoring.TopAfterResize`: bottom-docked, then top-anchored after the first resize
-   entry .fullscreenAnchoring   `Tui.Block.Anchoring.Fullscreen`: the alternate screen buffer, top-anchored
-   entry .flowAnchoring   `Tui.Block.Anchoring.Flow`: drawn relative to the cursor, flowing with prior output
+   entry .bottomDockedAnchoring   `Tui.Block.Anchoring.BottomDocked`: sempre acoplado embaixo, reacoplando a cada redimensionamento
+   entry .topAnchoring   `Tui.Block.Anchoring.TopAnchored`: fixado nas linhas do topo desde o primeiro quadro
+   entry .topAfterResizeAnchoring   `Tui.Block.Anchoring.TopAfterResize`: acoplado embaixo, depois ancorado no topo após o primeiro redimensionamento
